{"obsah":"<p>Last week was not only beautiful but also packed with work. On Thursday Lukáš Valný, Michal Budský and Vlasta rode an exhibition in eastern Bohemia for a pallet manufacturer at a private event. We have no photos, but together with the stage there was a solid combo of pallet obstacles that the guys made full use of, and the Czech and foreign guests clearly enjoyed it. </p>\n\n<p>On Saturday Vlasta headed to a small village near Nymburk as a stand-in for Šimon, who was ill, and rode at a village event before a promotion football match for lots of locals. Although it didn't look like a big turnout at first, a great crowd gathered that really got the event going, and Vlasta came close to his old record in the jump over the tape.</p>\n\n<p>Saturday and Sunday were all about individual courses – both small groups and young guns who want to move further.</p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<p>Náměšť nad Oslavou hosted its traditional MTB marathon for young and grown-up riders. Part of our team came along too – Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Martin Šimůnek and Márty Kabeláč. Things went a bit downhill – not because of the performances or the crowd, but simply because the whole square was on a slope. We dealt with it, hopefully with honour, and nobody got hurt in either of our shows before the start and before the marathon awards ceremony. Congratulations to all riders on their performances.</p>\n\n<p>Meanwhile Mára Tryner and Michal Budský were in picturesque Červená Voda, where a fair combined with a village festival took place, entertaining everyone in front of the main stage with our folding set of obstacles. Thanks to everyone for the invitation, and hopefully see you again sometime :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380135155_984918462618123_4694808614022352467_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380135155_984918462618123_4694808614022352467_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238551\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380228768_6605697789509185_1693559824739216369_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380228768_6605697789509185_1693559824739216369_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238550\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380340108_705258298118655_9181849828449922645_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380340108_705258298118655_9181849828449922645_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238548\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380394631_1014379199752749_879267965947250243_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F380394631_1014379199752749_879267965947250243_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238552\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F09%2F381773146_690688702938384_754700282509600364_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/